-All amounts are integer cents. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+Amounts are integers in the currency's minor unit. Supported currencies are USD (cents), JPY (yen, no decimals) and KWD (fils, three decimals).
+
+Functions that parse, format or display an amount take an optional last `currency` argument, defaulting to `"USD"`. JPY and KWD amounts must be plain numbers without thousands separators: `"1,234"` throws there, while USD keeps its lenient reading. Run the tests with `npm test`.
